    "threshold_selection": "Raised from the automatic 0.70 (chosen on mostly-lab validation photos) to 0.90 after a sweep on the 111 PlantDoc field validation photos: wrong answers fell from 7 to 3 between 0.70 and 0.90. The field test sweep agreed (15 -> 6 wrong answers on 187 photos)."
